# Default owners for the entire repository.
# All PRs require review from the core team unless a more specific rule below applies.
*       @AuraIDToken/core-team

# Security-critical paths — mandatory security-team review for every change.
# Requirement: Enterprise Readiness Audit T-02 (P0).
# Any modification to cryptographic primitives, the hash-chain, the decision
# engine, or the authentication middleware must be approved by @AuraIDToken/security-team
# before merging, regardless of who else has reviewed the PR.
src/crypto.rs   @AuraIDToken/security-team
src/chain.rs    @AuraIDToken/security-team
src/engine.rs   @AuraIDToken/security-team
src/auth.rs     @AuraIDToken/security-team

# Policy assets — changes to signed policies or the trusted-signers registry
# require security-team sign-off.
policies/                   @AuraIDToken/security-team
trusted_signers.json        @AuraIDToken/security-team

# CI/CD workflows — infrastructure changes need core-team approval.
.github/workflows/          @AuraIDToken/core-team

# Compliance and governance documents — owned by the security team.
docs/compliance-brief.md    @AuraIDToken/security-team
docs/threat-model.md        @AuraIDToken/security-team
docs/adr/                   @AuraIDToken/security-team
